  "problem": "${0}^{4}=${{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "Here, ${0}^{4}$ is in exponent form. The base is $0$ and the exponent is $4.$\n\nThis means that $0$ is taken as a factor $4$ times. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{0}^{4}={{0\\times 0\\times 0\\times 0}_{⏟}}_{4\\text{ times}}=0.\n$$",
